### VSCode REST Client Extension - API Test Suite
### Base URL Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Users Endpoint - Get All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Stats Endpoint - Get User Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Process Data Endpoint - Heavy Data Processing
GET {{baseUrl}}/process-data
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. External Data Endpoint - Fetch External APIs
GET {{baseUrl}}/external-data
Content-Type: application/json

###

